{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56506","headline":"还丹歌 · 岑真人","name":"还丹歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九链铅精大道成，我家何虑不长生？\n朝寻弄玉过仙府，暮谒麻姑入太清。\n神照本来自灵气，汉武荣知有俗情。\n万事只今空寂寞，一生飘荡落浮名。\n（《大还丹照监》）（按：《茅山志》卷七载唐成延昭号冲虚先生，未知即其人否。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}